A native Seeker, Galen and his brother grew up in [[Baja California, Mexico]] and eventually became allies of the [[Huntik Foundation]]. Galen trained with his brother in New York City with the Foundation, but stood out as they had learnt their powers through their ancient traditions. {{source|The Power of Umbra}}

Galen and Teeg helped [[Dante Vale]] find the entrance to [[Hernán Cortés' vault]] using their extensive charts and records {{Source|Gremlow Infestation!}}

Galen and Teeg later hosted [[Dante Vale]] and his team in Yucatan, and helped them to find the [[Ring]] of the Legendary Titan of Dimensions, [[Umbra]]. {{source|The Power of Umbra}}
